│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ moderate_param_tying_yy_xx_separation                                                     │
│ patch_description        │ The current program over-shares parameters (5 distinct), leading to underfitting and poor │
│                          │ worst-group margins (0.25). The best performer uses 10 distinct parameters with excellent │
│                          │ generalization. This edit implements moderate parameter tying by:                         │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 1. Using alternating RY parameters (ry_a, ry_b) instead of one global ry, allowing some   │
│                          │ per-qubit discrimination                                                                  │
│                          │ 2. Grouping XX gates with shared xx parameter (less diverse connectivity)                 │
│                          │ 3. Grouping YY gates with shared yy parameter (more diverse pairs benefit from shared     │
│                          │ learning)                                                                                 │
│                          │ 4. Keeping ZZ gates distinct to maintain expressiveness on long-range entanglement        │
│                          │ 5. Adding pre/post RZ layers with shared parameters for structured phase control          │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This reduces distinct parameters from the best's 10 to 8, balancing parameter economy     │
│                          │ with improved generalization and robustness. The goal is to recover the                   │
│                          │ worst_group_margin and validation margin while maintaining parameter efficiency.          │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0150                                                                                   │
│ error_attempt            │ None                                                                                      │
