│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ restore_structured_params_duplicate_ising                                                 │
│ patch_description        │ Restore the structured parameter approach from the best-performing program (score 0.58)   │
│                          │ and duplicate the Ising entangler block to deepen the circuit and enhance correlation     │
│                          │ capture for hard samples.                                                                 │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Key changes:                                                                              │
│                          │ 1. Add individual parameter names for each Ising gate pair (xx_01, xx_67, yy_23, yy_14,   │
│                          │ zz_45, zz_36) instead of sharing across all gates                                         │
│                          │ 2. Restore the pre-processing RZ layer (rz_pre) applied to all qubits before entanglement │
│                          │ 3. Duplicate the Ising entangler block immediately after the first sequence but before    │
│                          │ the post-processing RZ layer                                                              │
│                          │ 4. Reuse the same parameter names in the duplicated block (parameter sharing across the   │
│                          │ two repetitions, not changing n_distinct_params)                                          │
│                          │ 5. Restore post-processing RZ layer (rz_post) after all entanglement                      │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This maintains n_distinct_params=10 while achieving ~depth 30, leveraging the             │
│                          │ "sweet-spot" depth that drove the best program's success. The duplication intensifies     │
│                          │ qubit correlations to better separate hard samples (improving worst_group_margin),        │
│                          │ addressing the current program's weakness where worst_group_margin is only 0.25.          │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
