│ patch_description        │ Split the single rz_pre parameter into two parameters with parity-based assignment:       │
│                          │ rz_pre_even for qubits [0,2,4,6] and rz_pre_odd for qubits [1,3,5,7]. This mirrors the    │
│                          │ successful two-parameter RY parity assignment that was effective in prior program 2.      │
│                          │ Adding heterogeneity to the pre-entanglement phase should enhance the circuit's           │
│                          │ expressiveness and improve worst-group margin separation. Prior program 2 demonstrated    │
│                          │ that this parameter count (10 distinct) yields better validation accuracy (0.97 vs 0.92)  │
│                          │ and worst group margin (0.28 vs 0.24) compared to current program with 8 distinct         │
│                          │ parameters.                                                                               │
