│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ add_diagonal_crz_entangler                                                                │
│ patch_description        │ Add a long-range CRZ entangler layer on diagonal qubit pairs before the final RZ          │
│                          │ post-processing layer. This introduces cross-layer entanglement via the four diagonal     │
│                          │ pairs (0,5), (1,6), (2,7), (3,4), sharing a single parameter `crz_diag` to maintain       │
│                          │ parameter economy.                                                                        │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The rationale:                                                                            │
│                          │ 1. Current nearest-neighbor couplings (XX/YY/ZZ on adjacent pairs) may not capture        │
│                          │ correlations between distant qubits                                                       │
│                          │ 2. Diagonal pairs create fundamentally new entanglement patterns that can improve         │
│                          │ separation on hard samples                                                                │
│                          │ 3. Prior results show parameterized two-qubit coupling mixes improve worst-group margins  │
│                          │ 4. Single shared parameter keeps distinct parameter count at 11 (no efficiency penalty)   │
│                          │ 5. Placement before rz_post allows the final layer to exploit these new entanglement      │
│                          │ patterns                                                                                  │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This targets the worst_group_margin_mean (currently 0.31) which dominates the robustness  │
│                          │ score.                                                                                    │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0089                                                                                   │
