│ patch_type               │ full                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ parity_rx_enhanced_entangler                                                              │
│ patch_description        │ This redesign focuses on improving generalization and worst-group margin performance      │
│                          │ while maintaining parameter efficiency. Key structural changes:                           │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 1. **Simplified entangler layer**: Replace the problematic long-range CRZ diagonal layer  │
│                          │ (which appears to hurt generalization) with a cleaner nearest-neighbor + selective        │
│                          │ long-range XX/YY/ZZ pattern that worked well in prior iterations.                         │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 2. **Early parity RX layer**: Introduce a lightweight parity-based RX layer immediately   │
│                          │ after the pre-interaction RZ, adding orthogonal rotation axis mixing at minimal cost (~8  │
│                          │ gates, 2 params). This enhances local expressivity without excessive depth.               │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 3. **Reduced gate depth and count**: Remove redundant mid-circuit RZ layer and streamline │
│                          │ the overall structure to match the more successful architecture from the second prior     │
│                          │ program (score 0.59), which had better worst_group_margin and convergence.                │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 4. **Parameter focus**: Maintain 10 distinct parameters while optimizing gate selection   │
│                          │ for tighter worst-case separation on hard samples.                                        │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The prior program (score 0.59) achieved better worst_group_margin (0.31 vs 0.28) and      │
│                          │ faster convergence (90 vs 2160 steps) with a simpler structure. This version builds on    │
│                          │ that success while adding the RX parity layer recommendation for enhanced expressivity.   │
