│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ simplify_crz_central                                                                      │
│ patch_description        │ The current program is over-parameterized (16 distinct params) compared to the best prior │
│                          │ (10 distinct params) with worse generalization gap and parameter efficiency. The          │
│                          │ recommendation suggests using CRZ on the central [4,5] link to boost expressivity.        │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This edit:                                                                                │
│                          │ 1. Removes the second full block that doesn't improve generalization                      │
│                          │ 2. Returns to the proven single-block structure from the best prior (score 0.59)          │
│                          │ 3. Replaces the ZZ gate on [4,5] with a CRZ gate to test the recommended expressivity     │
│                          │ boost                                                                                     │
│                          │ 4. Reduces parameters from 16 to 10 distinct ones                                         │
│                          │ 5. Cuts depth from 30 to 15 and gate_count from 180 to 90                                 │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The key insight: controlled-rotation gates (CRX, CRY, CRZ) provide better expressivity    │
│                          │ than fixed Ising gates at the same parameter count, enabling the circuit to separate      │
│                          │ harder samples with fewer learnable parameters.                                           │
