│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ add_longrange_and_reduce_params                                                           │
│ patch_description        │ The current program has grown to 16 distinct parameters and depth 30, worse than prior    │
│                          │ Gen 2 (10 params, depth 15, score 0.59) and Gen 1 (12 params, depth 22, score 0.58).      │
│                          │ Over-parameterization hurts generalization on small training sets and reduces worst-group │
│                          │ margin (the key scoring component).                                                       │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This edit:                                                                                │
│                          │ 1. **Removes the duplicate second block** to reduce depth from 30 to 15                   │
│                          │ 2. **Collapses unique parameters** (e.g., crx_67, cry_14, crz_36 → single shared params)  │
│                          │ to drop from 16 to ~9 distinct parameters                                                 │
│                          │ 3. **Adds the recommended long-range XX(0,7) entangler** immediately after the main       │
│                          │ entanglement stage to improve connectivity and worst-group robustness                     │
│                          │ 4. **Restores the proven Gen 2 structure** which achieved 0.59 combined score             │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This targets parameter efficiency (most heavily weighted per instructions) while adding   │
│                          │ proven long-range connectivity for margin improvement.                                    │
